OtaNix ry organizes a Nix workshop on the topics of PGP and YubiKey.
The workshop is organized on Monday the 10th of August from 18:00 onwards.
The venue is Ossinkulma, Otakaari 18 A. Food and snacks will be served!

We recommend bringing your own laptop in order to participate. If you own a YubiKey or a similar device, make sure to bring that too!

Please sign up for the workshop #link("https://nextcloud.otanix.fi/apps/forms/s/MRbDzpdK22io8n9RQQ3Tdrbm")[here].

For any questions, please contact luukas.portfors\@aalto.fi

